<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Jan car registrations rise 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Jan car registrations rise 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations rose a seasonally-adjusted 2.9 percent in January to 55,591, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists had generally been looking for a rise of around 2.0 percent.</p>
</text>
